WEBVTT

00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:17,820
Do we need to sleep with grounding sheets? No. And if you do use a grounding sheet,

00:00:17,820 --> 00:00:23,340
you only use it on the lower half of your body. So you put it across your whole bed

00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:29,580
on the lower half of your bed. The person who asked a question about it said they used it

00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:34,220
from their knees down, but you could do it from your trunk down from your buttocks down.

00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:41,820
You put the grounding sheet on the lower half of your bed underneath your fitted sheet.

